<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>CareToShare | Citizen Accessible Routing & Real-Time Utility Alerts</title>
    <style>
        :root { --primary: #0f172a; --accent: #2563eb; --safe: #16a34a; --danger: #dc2626; --bg: #f8fafc; }
        body { font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, "Segoe UI", Roboto, sans-serif; background: var(--bg); color: var(--primary); margin: 0; padding: 0; }
        header { background: var(--primary); color: white; padding: 1.5rem; text-align: center; }
        .container { max-width: 900px; margin: 2rem auto; padding: 0 1rem; }
        .card { background: white; border-radius: 8px; padding: 1.5rem; margin-bottom: 1.5rem; box-shadow: 0 4px 6px -1px rgb(0 0 0 / 0.1); }
        h2 { margin-top: 0; color: var(--accent); }
        .status-badge { display: inline-block; padding: 0.25rem 0.75rem; border-radius: 9999px; font-weight: bold; font-size: 0.875rem; }
        .status-safe { background: #dcfce7; color: var(--safe); }
        .status-alert { background: #fee2e2; color: var(--danger); }
        button { background: var(--accent); color: white; border: none; padding: 0.75rem 1.5rem; border-radius: 6px; font-size: 1rem; cursor: pointer; }
        button:hover { opacity: 0.9; }
        #map-placeholder { width: 100%; height: 300px; background: #e2e8f0; border-radius: 6px; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; color: #64748b; font-weight: 500; margin-top: 1rem; }
        .footer-note { text-align: center; font-size: 0.8rem; color: #64748b; margin-top: 2rem; }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <header>
        <h1>CareToShare Municipal Portal</h1>
        <p>Free Real-Time Accessible Routing, Battery Range, & Construction Alerts</p>
    </header>
    <div class="container">
        <div class="card">
            <h2>Live Route Safety & Terrain Status</h2>
            <p>Current Location Status: <span id="route-status" class="status-badge status-safe">All Clear - Safe Accessible Grade</span></p>
            <p>Active Municipal Utility Digs Detected Ahead: <strong>None on current path</strong></p>
            <div id="map-placeholder">[ Live LiDAR Accessibility & Freeze-Thaw Overlay Active ]</div>
        </div>
        <div class="card">
            <h2>Mobility Device Battery & Slope Calculator</h2>
            <label for="battery">Battery Level (%):</label>
            <input type="number" id="battery" value="85" min="1" max="100" style="padding: 0.5rem; margin-right: 1rem; width: 80px;">
            <label for="slope">Route Max Slope (%):</label>
            <input type="number" id="slope" value="5.0" step="0.1" style="padding: 0.5rem; margin-right: 1rem; width: 80px;">
            <button onclick="calculateRange()">Estimate Safe Range</button>
            <p id="range-result" style="margin-top: 1rem; font-weight: bold;"></p>
        </div>
    </div>
    <div class="footer-note">
        Powered by Apex Precision Markings LLC | Autonomous System Last Synced: Live Autonomous Feed
    </div>
    <script>
        function calculateRange() {
            const battery = document.getElementById('battery').value;
            const slope = document.getElementById('slope').value;
            const range = (battery * 12.5 * (1.0 - Math.max(0, slope) / 20.0)).toFixed(1);
            document.getElementById('range-result',).innerText = `Estimated Safe Operational Range: ${range} meters`;
        }
    </script>
</body>
</html>
